\f6\fs62 Map<K, Set<T>>
\f4\fs60 , etc. if you give a downstream collector).\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Use case
\f4\b0 : When you want to group data into multiple categories.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Example
\f4\b0 :\
