\f2\b block
\f4\b0 .\
\ls17\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Implicitly acquires and releases the lock.\
\ls17\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Once the thread exits the block/method, the lock is 
