\f4\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls22\ilvl1\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	
\f5 \uc0\u9702 
\f4 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
If Thread A updates a 
\f6\fs52 volatile
\f4\fs50  variable, Thread B will see the updated value immediately.\
\ls22\ilvl1\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	
\f5 \uc0\u9702 
\f4 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Without 
\f6\fs52 volatile
\f4\fs50 , Thread B may see a 
\f2\b stale cached value
\f4\b0 .\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls22\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
