\f4\b0\fs50 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
In 
\f2\b JPA
\f4\b0 , inheritance allows you to map an 
\f2\b object-oriented class hierarchy
\f4\b0  to database tables. JPA provides three main strategies for inheritance mapping. Let\'92s go step by step.\
