\f2\b\fs62 \cf0 3. Table Per Class (
\f3\fs65 TABLE_PER_CLASS
\f2\fs62 )\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls28\ilvl0
\f4\b0\fs50 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Each concrete class has its 
\f2\b own table
\f4\b0  with all fields of parent included.\
\ls28\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
No parent table is used for storing data.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf0 Example:
\f4\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f6\fs52 \cf0 \
@Entity\
@Inheritance(strategy = InheritanceType.TABLE_PER_CLASS)\
public abstract class Vehicle \{\
    @Id\
    private Long id;\
    private String manufacturer;\
\}\
\
@Entity\
public class Car extends Vehicle \{\
    private int seatingCapacity;\
\}\
\
@Entity\
public class Bike extends Vehicle \{\
    private boolean hasCarrier;\
\}\
